{"c":[{"name":"20261004T004204Z-9249ce81a51a9397","text":"WKWebView in a window that is not key applies an AXValue write to whichever field has focus (none: dropped; another: overwritten). The reader focuses a WebKit web field first (focusValue): 3/3 landed, no raise or activation; typing or paste to the pid land 0/3 (B20).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T015937Z-03e29f7fee084743","text":"The shadow store keeps element keys only as hashes, so an offline replay cannot recover templates or positions; scripts/real-day-replay.ts counts are approximations both ways; memory.sqlite routine rows are the faithful count (B21).","type":"note"}]}
